{"id": "UCEIa6uIuby6yeTlaC0dP34Q", "channel": "Stick It Out", "channel_id": "UCEIa6uIuby6yeTlaC0dP34Q", "title": "Stick It Out - Videos", "availability": "public", "channel_follower_count": 2170, "description": "Animated survival movies where YOU are the protagonist.\n\nZombie apocalypse, zombie outbreak, nuclear war, extreme cold, an empty world where everyone vanished and many more: every film is one full survival story, from Day 1 to Day 100, one year or ten years, about an hour long.\n\nThe threat is fiction; what keeps you alive is real survival know-how: water, food, cold, fire, injuries, and the choices you make with the people you meet.\n\nHow our films are made: every story is original and written for this channel only. Each one starts with research into real survival, emergency and public-health sources; the script is written, reviewed and rewritten around that research, and the survival facts are checked before production. Then every scene is designed and animated for that film: our own recurring characters, sets drawn for each story, an original score and sound design.\n\nNew full-movie survival stories every week. Subscribe and see if you can stick it out.\n\n", "tags": ["stick it out", "how to survive", "survival guide", "how to survive when the grid goes down", "power outage survival", "grid down survival", "blackout survival", "winter blackout", "emergency preparedness", "how to prepare for a disaster", "bunker survival", "nuclear survival", "survival tips", "prepping for beginners", "what to do in an emergency", "animated survival guide", "survival scenarios"], "thumbnails": [{"url": "https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/oIFVfAxUCUHqVWyRO07DFqPRV7fPr5r-enUyKwnIsjHq9hsizI96BjfOhszIXMkllh30L5R6jw8=w1060-fcrop64=1,00005a57ffffa5a8-k-c0xffffffff-no-nd-rj", "height": 175, "width": 1060, "preference": -10, "id": "0", "resolution": "1060x175"}, {"url": "https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/oIFVfAxUCUHqVWyRO07DFqPRV7fPr5r-enUyKwnIsjHq9hsizI96BjfOhszIXMkllh30L5R6j